  "html": "<article id=\"post-5842\" class=\"container post-5842 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">Indoor Air Quality &#8211; Do you know what pollutants might be lurking in your home?</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2024-10-29T23:30:17+00:00\">October 29, 2024</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2025-04-12T01:07:17+00:00\">April 12, 2025</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1536x1024-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Indoor Air Quality system in a residential home in Greenville, SC\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1536x1024-1.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1536x1024-1-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1536x1024-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1536x1024-1-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\t\t<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Curious about the <a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality\">indoor air quality</a> in your Greenville home? Testing can reveal what’s truly in the air you breathe!</strong></p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enhancing Indoor Air Quality: Assess, Act, Protect</h2>\n<p>Indoor air quality (IAQ) is vital for the health, comfort, and safety of your family. At Carolina Heating Service, we prioritize creating clean, healthy air by reducing allergens, pollutants, and contaminants that impact your quality of life. With our tried-and-true approach of <strong>Assess</strong>, <strong>Act</strong>, <strong>Protect</strong>, you can breathe easy knowing your Greenville home is a safer place.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Assess: Check Your Air Quality</h2>\n<p>Improving indoor air quality begins with a comprehensive <strong>assessment</strong>. Many airborne pollutants, such as dust, mold, bacteria, viruses, and volatile organic compounds (VOCs) from household products, often go unnoticed without testing. Identifying these contaminants is crucial for a healthier indoor environment. IAQ testing helps uncover invisible pollutants, ensuring your air quality is optimized. Typical concerns that IAQ testing addresses include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Allergens</strong>: Dust, pollen, pet dander, and other particles can cause respiratory issues and worsen allergies.</li>\n<li><strong>Mold spores</strong>: High humidity encourages mold growth, which can significantly degrade indoor air quality and pose risks to health.</li>\n<li><strong>Chemical pollutants</strong>: Many everyday items, like cleaning products and paints, release VOCs that reduce air quality. Opting for eco-friendly or homemade cleaning alternatives can help minimize these emissions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><em>With our IAQ testing services, we offer a complete analysis that empowers you to identify and address harmful pollutants in your home.<br /><br /></em></h4>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Act: Address IAQ Challenges</h2>\n<p>Once air quality issues are identified, it’s important to take targeted action. Effective solutions for improving air quality include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Air filtration systems</strong>: High-efficiency air filters and purifiers help capture particles and contaminants, making your indoor environment cleaner.</li>\n<li><strong>Improved ventilation</strong>: Proper ventilation allows fresh air to circulate, removing stale air and reducing indoor pollutants.</li>\n<li><strong>Humidity control</strong>: Using dehumidifiers or adjusting your HVAC system can help maintain optimal humidity levels, preventing mold and promoting overall air quality.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Acting on these IAQ issues not only contributes to a healthier home but can also enhance property value and provide long-term benefits for you and your family.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Protect: Sustain High-Quality Indoor Air</h2>\n<p>Maintaining high IAQ requires proactive measures that keep indoor air clean and pollutant-free. Some of the best ways to sustain clean air include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Regular HVAC maintenance</strong>: Regular filter replacements and HVAC checks help ensure efficient system performance, reducing contaminants.</li>\n<li><strong>Balanced ventilation</strong>: Using exhaust fans, maintaining good airflow, and occasionally opening windows can significantly improve indoor air quality.</li>\n<li><strong>HEPA air purifiers</strong>: Air purifiers equipped with HEPA filters capture up to 99.97% of airborne particles, helping keep your air fresh and clean.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Our <strong>Assess, Act, Protect</strong> framework ensures that your air remains clean, providing peace of mind for you and your loved ones. Reach out to Carolina Heating Service today for an IAQ assessment or to learn about our air filtration solutions. Start your journey to cleaner, healthier air in Greenville!</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a></div></div>\n\n                </div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n    <footer class=\"entry-footer container has-gray-light-background-color has-background py-5\">\n        <div>\n\t<h3 class=\"h2\">Recommended Reads:</h3>\n\t<a href=\"/about-us/blog\">Read All Blog Posts</a>\n\t<div class=\"my-4 nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--4-up multi-component-container--uniform-height\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/air-conditioning-installation-costs-greenville-sc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"640\" height=\"359\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"An exterior of a building with multiple AC units and flowers\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1024x574.jpg 1024w, /i